@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/api/teams

### Get all teams
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new team
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manchester United",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "players": []
}

###

### Create another team
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Liverpool FC",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
  "players": ["507f1f77bcf86cd799439013", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439014"]
}

###

### Create a team with no players
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chelsea FC",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439015"
}

###

### Get a specific team by ID (replace with actual ObjectId from create response)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update a team (replace with actual ObjectId)
PUT {{endpoint}}/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manchester United FC",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "players": ["507f1f77bcf86cd799439016", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439017", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439018", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439019"]
}

###

### Update team - add players (replace with actual ObjectId)
PUT {{endpoint}}/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "players": ["507f1f77bcf86cd799439020", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439021", "507f1f77bcf86cd799439022"]
}

###

### Delete a team (replace with actual ObjectId)
DELETE {{endpoint}}/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test creating team with minimal required fields
POST {{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arsenal FC",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439023"
}

###

### ===== ERROR SCENARIO TESTS =====

### 2. POST request which fails validation - Missing required fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Team"
}

###

### POST request which fails validation - Name too short
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FC",
  "coach": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011"
}

###

### POST request which fails validation - Invalid coach reference
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Team FC",
  "coach": "InvalidCoachId"
}

###

### 5. GET request on an individual resource which fails (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999

###

### 7. DELETE request on an individual resource which fails (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999

###

### 9. PUT request on an individual resource which fails as the resource cannot be found (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Team Name"
}

###

### 10. PUT request on an individual resource which fails as the data is not valid
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FC"
}

###

### PUT request validation failure - Invalid coach reference
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/teams/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coach": "InvalidCoachId"
}